# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

*.log

# Scratch files: throwaway Node patch scripts, one-off measurement harnesses
# and commit-message files written to disk to dodge shell quoting. These keep
# being swept into commits by `git add -A`, so they are ignored explicitly.
_*.js
_*.html
_msg*.txt

# Nothing else needs ignoring — the site is static.
# (No node_modules: there is no build step. sql.js is vendored in vendor/,
# so nothing is fetched from a CDN at runtime either.)